[{"text": "Hello, everyone. Welcome back to another great lesson with us here at EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.2000000000000013, "end": 6.48}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.8, "end": 7.56}, {"text": "And today we're going out to eat.", "start": 8.02, "end": 10.52}, {"text": "Yes, good thing too, because I'm hungry.", "start": 10.78, "end": 12.78}, {"text": "I know, it's almost lunchtime.", "start": 13.12, "end": 14.24}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 14.32, "end": 14.56}, {"text": "So today we're going to be talking about eating at a restaurant and giving some great recommendations and suggestions.", "start": 14.9, "end": 20.5}, {"text": "Yes, we have language for describing food, for describing restaurants, and for making suggestions.", "start": 20.96, "end": 27.86}, {"text": "Great. So let's start with our vocabulary preview for this lesson.", "start": 27.86, "end": 31.14}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 31.78, "end": 33.06}, {"text": "We have two words today from our dialogue, which you'll need to know to understand the dialogue.", "start": 33.92, "end": 39.84}, {"text": "Great. The first one that we have today is food poisoning.", "start": 40.12, "end": 44.18}, {"text": "Food poisoning.", "start": 44.52, "end": 45.7}, {"text": "Food poisoning.", "start": 46.12, "end": 46.9}, {"text": "Food poisoning.", "start": 47.12, "end": 48.02}, {"text": "So food poisoning is...", "start": 48.5, "end": 50.54}, {"text": "Not a good thing.", "start": 50.54, "end": 51.84}, {"text": "Not a good thing.", "start": 51.94, "end": 52.68}, {"text": "It is when you eat some bad food and that food makes you sick.", "start": 52.68, "end": 58.7}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 58.8, "end": 59.0}, {"text": "So you get food poisoning.", "start": 59.0, "end": 60.54}, {"text": "Okay. So food poisoning. Yeah. Not a good thing.", "start": 60.9, "end": 63.82}, {"text": "Okay. The next word.", "start": 64.04, "end": 65.02}, {"text": "Allergic.", "start": 65.34, "end": 65.96}, {"text": "Allergic.", "start": 66.46, "end": 67.08}, {"text": "Allergic.", "start": 67.46, "end": 68.08}, {"text": "Allergic.", "start": 68.9, "end": 69.52}, {"text": "So when you're allergic to something...", "start": 70.0, "end": 72.76}, {"text": "It makes you sick. That one thing makes you sick.", "start": 72.76, "end": 76.16}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 76.4, "end": 76.64}, {"text": "For example, I'm allergic to seafood.", "start": 76.64, "end": 79.02}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 79.34, "end": 79.74}, {"text": "If I eat seafood, I cannot breathe.", "start": 80.12, "end": 83.1}, {"text": "Okay. So you definitely want to stay away from fish.", "start": 83.46, "end": 86.42}, {"text": "Yes. Yes.", "start": 86.56, "end": 87.5}, {"text": "Some people are allergic to nuts, like peanuts.", "start": 87.72, "end": 90.14}, {"text": "Or maybe milk.", "start": 90.48, "end": 91.32}, {"text": "Milk.", "start": 91.54, "end": 91.9}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 92.1, "end": 92.2}, {"text": "Cool.", "start": 92.58, "end": 92.8}, {"text": "So when one type of food makes you sick, you are allergic to that food.", "start": 93.0, "end": 97.38}, {"text": "Okay. Great.", "start": 97.62, "end": 98.82}, {"text": "Great. So with this in mind, now we can listen to our dialogue for the first time at its normal speed.", "start": 98.82, "end": 104.4}, {"text": "But don't worry if you don't get everything now because...", "start": 104.4, "end": 107.32}, {"text": "We'll come back and teach you the important language.", "start": 107.32, "end": 109.72}, {"text": "Do you two have any plans for the evening?", "start": 115.02, "end": 116.94}, {"text": "We were thinking of checking out a restaurant in the neighborhood.", "start": 117.2, "end": 120.0}, {"text": "Do you have any suggestions?", "start": 120.36, "end": 121.5}, {"text": "I know this really nice Italian place.", "start": 121.98, "end": 124.0}, {"text": "The food is fantastic and the decor is beautiful.", "start": 124.18, "end": 126.88}, {"text": "I'd recommend giving it a try.", "start": 127.26, "end": 128.64}, {"text": "Actually, I'm not all that crazy about Italian food.", "start": 129.32000000000002, "end": 132.26}, {"text": "I'm in the mood for something a bit lighter.", "start": 132.64, "end": 134.64}, {"text": "In that case, I know a great little bistro.", "start": 135.08, "end": 137.18}, {"text": "They make a really tasty seafood platter.", "start": 137.36, "end": 139.5}, {"text": "The fish is outstanding.", "start": 139.84, "end": 141.16}, {"text": "It sounds fantastic, but I'm allergic to seafood, so...", "start": 141.62, "end": 145.98}, {"text": "Okay. Well, let me think.", "start": 145.98, "end": 148.18}, {"text": "Oh, I know this great little place.", "start": 149.68, "end": 151.46}, {"text": "It's just a hole in the wall, but they do the most amazing sandwiches.", "start": 151.46, "end": 155.08}, {"text": "You've got to give them a try.", "start": 155.5, "end": 156.66}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 156.66, "end": 156.68}, {"text": "Ella, you took me there last time I visited, and I got food poisoning, remember?", "start": 157.46, "end": 161.64}, {"text": "Well, I'm getting hungry just thinking about all of those great restaurants.", "start": 167.82, "end": 172.02}, {"text": "Yeah, some really good recommendations, except for food poisoning, right?", "start": 172.16, "end": 175.6}, {"text": "No, not so good.", "start": 175.6, "end": 176.8}, {"text": "Let's start with our language takeaway for this lesson.", "start": 177.16, "end": 180.6}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 182.04, "end": 183.36}, {"text": "Our first word on language takeaway is check out.", "start": 184.6, "end": 188.52}, {"text": "Check out.", "start": 188.92, "end": 189.94}, {"text": "Check out.", "start": 190.3, "end": 190.98}, {"text": "Check out.", "start": 191.18, "end": 191.78}, {"text": "Check out.", "start": 192.26000000000002, "end": 192.74}, {"text": "So we have some great examples on how we can use check out in different situations, and", "start": 192.74, "end": 197.04}, {"text": "then you can understand the meaning.", "start": 197.04, "end": 198.26}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 199.38000000000002, "end": 200.2}, {"text": "Have you been to the new cafe next door?", "start": 201.92000000000002, "end": 203.92}, {"text": "Yeah, I checked it out yesterday.", "start": 204.38, "end": 205.66}, {"text": "The food was great.", "start": 205.92, "end": 206.78}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 210.3, "end": 211.08}, {"text": "Hey, check out my new car.", "start": 214.22, "end": 215.86}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 219.98, "end": 220.8}, {"text": "I'm going to check out the new shopping mall this weekend.", "start": 224.06, "end": 226.38}, {"text": "So I can understand that it just means look at.", "start": 229.52, "end": 232.3}, {"text": "Yeah, look at.", "start": 232.56, "end": 233.08}, {"text": "Or, yeah, or go see.", "start": 233.2, "end": 234.4}, {"text": "So let's go check out that new bar in town.", "start": 234.52, "end": 236.6}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 236.78, "end": 237.12}, {"text": "Okay, cool.", "start": 237.48, "end": 238.02}, {"text": "Next word is bistro.", "start": 238.26, "end": 240.06}, {"text": "Bistro.", "start": 240.96, "end": 241.4}, {"text": "Bistro.", "start": 241.82, "end": 242.26}, {"text": "Bistro.", "start": 242.96, "end": 243.4}, {"text": "So what's a bistro?", "start": 243.4, "end": 245.2}, {"text": "It's kind of complicated, but it's like a small restaurant that's not really cheap, though.", "start": 245.52, "end": 250.64}, {"text": "Not so cheap, but not so expensive.", "start": 251.06, "end": 252.7}, {"text": "And it's usually French.", "start": 253.36, "end": 255.46}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 255.8, "end": 256.02}, {"text": "So it's...", "start": 256.34, "end": 257.2}, {"text": "Small, informal restaurant.", "start": 257.2, "end": 258.52}, {"text": "Yeah, bistro.", "start": 258.64, "end": 259.3}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 259.46, "end": 259.9}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 260.4, "end": 260.88}, {"text": "So our third phrase for today is not all that crazy about.", "start": 260.88, "end": 265.92}, {"text": "Not all that crazy about.", "start": 266.22, "end": 268.26}, {"text": "I'm not all that crazy about.", "start": 268.56, "end": 271.2}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 271.62, "end": 272.1}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 272.1, "end": 272.24}, {"text": "Again, kind of a funny phrase, but we've got some examples that will help you understand", "start": 272.68, "end": 277.5}, {"text": "the meaning.", "start": 277.5, "end": 277.94}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 279.72, "end": 280.58}, {"text": "Do you want to go shopping with me tomorrow?", "start": 284.12, "end": 285.9}, {"text": "I'm not all that crazy about shopping.", "start": 286.44, "end": 288.38}, {"text": "I don't like spending money.", "start": 288.54, "end": 289.68}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 294.12, "end": 294.92}, {"text": "I'm not crazy about jazz music.", "start": 298.29999999999995, "end": 300.26}, {"text": "Can I change the song?", "start": 300.46, "end": 301.42}, {"text": "So this is just a really polite way of saying you don't like something.", "start": 304.7, "end": 308.6}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 308.88, "end": 309.18}, {"text": "But now the opposite of this would be tasty.", "start": 309.18, "end": 312.88}, {"text": "Tasty.", "start": 313.22, "end": 313.8}, {"text": "That's our fourth word.", "start": 314.1, "end": 315.06}, {"text": "Tasty.", "start": 315.24, "end": 315.78}, {"text": "Tasty.", "start": 316.0, "end": 316.44}, {"text": "So when something is tasty...", "start": 317.0, "end": 319.02}, {"text": "It's good.", "start": 319.02, "end": 319.66}, {"text": "It's good.", "start": 319.84, "end": 320.32}, {"text": "Like delicious.", "start": 320.46, "end": 321.0}, {"text": "Delicious.", "start": 321.32, "end": 321.64}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 321.94, "end": 322.06}, {"text": "You know what?", "start": 322.22, "end": 322.56}, {"text": "In English, we almost never say the food is delicious, but we always say...", "start": 322.56, "end": 327.62}, {"text": "It's really tasty.", "start": 327.62, "end": 328.9}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 329.08, "end": 329.28}, {"text": "This is really tasty.", "start": 329.48, "end": 330.36}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 330.5, "end": 330.66}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 330.94, "end": 331.14}, {"text": "Tasty.", "start": 331.46, "end": 331.8}, {"text": "And our last phrase for language takeaway...", "start": 332.52, "end": 335.8}, {"text": "In the mood for.", "start": 336.52, "end": 337.26}, {"text": "In the mood for.", "start": 337.54, "end": 339.32}, {"text": "In the mood for.", "start": 339.62, "end": 340.84}, {"text": "Let's listen to some examples of this phrase and we'll understand the meaning a little bit", "start": 341.28, "end": 345.94}, {"text": "better.", "start": 345.94, "end": 346.26}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 347.12, "end": 348.08}, {"text": "We always eat hamburgers for dinner.", "start": 350.21999999999997, "end": 352.48}, {"text": "I'm in the mood for something different.", "start": 352.68, "end": 353.8}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 357.18, "end": 358.1}, {"text": "Let's watch a movie.", "start": 360.8, "end": 361.92}, {"text": "How about Texas Chainsaw Massacre?", "start": 362.2, "end": 364.16}, {"text": "I am not in the mood for a horror movie.", "start": 364.44, "end": 366.94}, {"text": "So if I'm in the mood for something, I feel like doing or eating or...", "start": 369.52000000000004, "end": 375.44}, {"text": "Watching.", "start": 375.44, "end": 375.92}, {"text": "Watching.", "start": 376.22, "end": 376.46}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 376.64, "end": 376.76}, {"text": "It means you want to do that now.", "start": 376.9, "end": 378.48}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 378.66, "end": 379.18}, {"text": "I'm in the mood for.", "start": 379.5, "end": 380.54}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 380.76, "end": 381.18}, {"text": "Some great language we just looked at.", "start": 381.98, "end": 384.36}, {"text": "And I think it's time for us to listen to the dialogue a second time.", "start": 384.36, "end": 388.3}, {"text": "Do you two have any plans for the evening?", "start": 393.58, "end": 396.66}, {"text": "We were thinking of checking out a restaurant in the neighborhood.", "start": 397.28, "end": 401.02}, {"text": "Do you have any suggestions?", "start": 401.74, "end": 403.02}, {"text": "I know this really nice Italian place.", "start": 403.90000000000003, "end": 407.18}, {"text": "The food is fantastic.", "start": 407.46, "end": 409.26}, {"text": "And the decor is beautiful.", "start": 409.94, "end": 411.72}, {"text": "I'd recommend giving it a try.", "start": 412.14, "end": 414.28}, {"text": "Actually, I'm not all that crazy about Italian food.", "start": 415.24, "end": 419.38}, {"text": "I'm in the mood for something a bit lighter.", "start": 419.74, "end": 422.7}, {"text": "In that case, I know a great little bistro.", "start": 423.48, "end": 426.74}, {"text": "They make a really tasty seafood platter.", "start": 426.96, "end": 429.84}, {"text": "The fish is outstanding.", "start": 430.36, "end": 432.02}, {"text": "It sounds fantastic.", "start": 432.8, "end": 434.78}, {"text": "But I'm allergic to seafood, so...", "start": 435.4, "end": 439.22}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 439.22, "end": 439.8}, {"text": "Well, let me think.", "start": 440.1, "end": 441.62}, {"text": "Oh, I know this great little place.", "start": 442.12, "end": 444.82}, {"text": "It's just a hole in the wall.", "start": 445.0, "end": 447.32}, {"text": "But they do the most amazing sandwiches.", "start": 447.52, "end": 450.8}, {"text": "You've got to give them a try.", "start": 451.16, "end": 452.94}, {"text": "Ella, you took me there last time I visited.", "start": 454.0, "end": 457.82}, {"text": "And I got food poisoning.", "start": 458.14, "end": 459.64}, {"text": "Remember?", "start": 460.02, "end": 460.34}, {"text": "Remember?", "start": 463.3, "end": 463.82}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 464.22, "end": 464.74}, {"text": "Some really great and useful phrases there.", "start": 464.94, "end": 467.06}, {"text": "And I know you want to talk about specifically some of these phrases.", "start": 467.22, "end": 470.06}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 470.32, "end": 470.54}, {"text": "Today's lesson is all about making recommendations, right?", "start": 470.76, "end": 474.64}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 474.88, "end": 475.26}, {"text": "So let's look at some useful phrases in Fluency Builder.", "start": 475.56, "end": 479.1}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 480.3, "end": 481.34}, {"text": "So in the dialogue, we heard a great way of asking for a suggestion.", "start": 481.52, "end": 485.24}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 485.52, "end": 485.9}, {"text": "Let's listen.", "start": 486.16, "end": 486.66}, {"text": "Do you have any suggestions?", "start": 487.22, "end": 488.64}, {"text": "No.", "start": 489.18, "end": 489.7}, {"text": "Do you have any suggestions?", "start": 490.78000000000003, "end": 492.34}, {"text": "So that's how you would ask for a suggestion.", "start": 493.36, "end": 495.76}, {"text": "Or you can say something else like, do you have any ideas?", "start": 495.76, "end": 498.8}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 499.18, "end": 499.5}, {"text": "Or you might say, do you have any thoughts?", "start": 499.72, "end": 501.82}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 502.2, "end": 502.32}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 502.88, "end": 503.14}, {"text": "Three great ways.", "start": 503.42, "end": 504.24}, {"text": "So that's asking for suggestions.", "start": 504.64, "end": 505.56}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 505.72, "end": 505.84}, {"text": "In response to this, you can say something like this.", "start": 505.84, "end": 509.8}, {"text": "I'd recommend giving it a try.", "start": 510.7, "end": 512.28}, {"text": "I'd recommend giving it a try.", "start": 513.8, "end": 515.96}, {"text": "We also heard another phrase that we use for giving suggestions.", "start": 517.06, "end": 520.7}, {"text": "You've got to give them a try.", "start": 522.12, "end": 523.16}, {"text": "You've got to give them a try.", "start": 525.36, "end": 527.02}, {"text": "So these two phrases are great.", "start": 528.1, "end": 530.06}, {"text": "I'd recommend or you've got to give them a try.", "start": 530.26, "end": 533.1}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 533.54, "end": 533.8}, {"text": "Great ways of suggesting.", "start": 534.24, "end": 535.4}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 535.7, "end": 535.98}, {"text": "Now, what's really important here is the pronunciation of these words, right?", "start": 536.36, "end": 539.9}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 540.12, "end": 540.46}, {"text": "You'll notice that we don't say, I would recommend.", "start": 540.46, "end": 545.08}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 545.08, "end": 545.8}, {"text": "We use the contraction, I'd.", "start": 546.16, "end": 547.86}, {"text": "I'd.", "start": 548.06, "end": 548.62}, {"text": "I'd.", "start": 548.76, "end": 549.26}, {"text": "I'd recommend.", "start": 549.32, "end": 550.0}, {"text": "I'd recommend.", "start": 550.34, "end": 550.9}, {"text": "Similarly, in the phrase, you have got to, we shorten that to say, you gotta.", "start": 551.6400000000001, "end": 559.82}, {"text": "You gotta.", "start": 560.04, "end": 560.54}, {"text": "You gotta give them a try.", "start": 560.76, "end": 561.78}, {"text": "You gotta.", "start": 561.88, "end": 562.4}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 562.78, "end": 563.08}, {"text": "You know what, guys?", "start": 563.24, "end": 563.96}, {"text": "If you can shorten your phrases like this, if you can push the sounds together, you'll sound", "start": 563.96, "end": 569.72}, {"text": "a lot more natural, hey?", "start": 569.72, "end": 571.6}, {"text": "", "start": 571.6, "end": 571.6}, {"text": "And also, you'll be able to understand because in movies or in shows, they will never say,", "start": 571.76, "end": 576.98}, {"text": "you have got to give them a try.", "start": 577.18, "end": 578.72}, {"text": "", "start": 578.98, "end": 578.98}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 579.1, "end": 579.12}, {"text": "So if you know how to use this form, you'll understand what they mean.", "start": 579.22, "end": 583.3}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 583.54, "end": 584.02}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 584.54, "end": 584.78}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 584.98, "end": 585.18}, {"text": "Well, why don't we listen to the dialogue a third time and you'll hear some of these contractions", "start": 585.42, "end": 590.38}, {"text": "in the dialogue.", "start": 590.38, "end": 591.2}, {"text": "Do you two have any plans for the evening?", "start": 596.26, "end": 598.18}, {"text": "We were thinking of checking out a restaurant in the neighborhood.", "start": 598.42, "end": 601.24}, {"text": "Do you have any suggestions?", "start": 601.6, "end": 602.74}, {"text": "I know this really nice Italian place.", "start": 603.2, "end": 605.2}, {"text": "The food is fantastic and the decor is beautiful.", "start": 605.42, "end": 608.1}, {"text": "I'd recommend giving it a try.", "start": 608.48, "end": 609.88}, {"text": "Actually, I'm not all that crazy about Italian food.", "start": 610.62, "end": 613.48}, {"text": "I'm in the mood for something a bit lighter.", "start": 613.86, "end": 615.88}, {"text": "In that case, I know a great little bistro.", "start": 616.32, "end": 618.4}, {"text": "They make a really tasty seafood platter.", "start": 618.58, "end": 620.74}, {"text": "The fish is outstanding.", "start": 621.1, "end": 622.38}, {"text": "It sounds fantastic, but I'm allergic to seafood, so...", "start": 622.8599999999999, "end": 627.2}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 627.2, "end": 627.68}, {"text": "Well, let me think.", "start": 628.02, "end": 629.38}, {"text": "Oh, I know this great little place.", "start": 630.96, "end": 632.7}, {"text": "It's just a hole in the wall, but they do the most amazing sandwiches.", "start": 632.74, "end": 636.3}, {"text": "You've got to give them a try.", "start": 636.76, "end": 637.9}, {"text": "Ella, you took me there last time I visited and I got food poisoning, remember?", "start": 638.76, "end": 642.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 648.12, "end": 648.68}, {"text": "", "start": 648.9, "end": 648.9}, {"text": "Great dialogue.", "start": 649.0, "end": 649.64}, {"text": "And Erica, I know that you have some food poisoning stories for us.", "start": 649.96, "end": 653.92}, {"text": "Well, I don't know about stories, but I've definitely had food poisoning before.", "start": 654.08, "end": 658.22}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 658.62, "end": 658.88}, {"text": "One of the worst times that I ever had food poisoning was when I was traveling in Morocco.", "start": 658.88, "end": 663.74}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 664.16, "end": 664.44}, {"text": "I had some really amazing orange juice, really fresh, squeezed that day in the morning.", "start": 664.96, "end": 671.2}, {"text": "And then I got on a bus.", "start": 671.98, "end": 673.4}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 674.02, "end": 674.5}, {"text": "I think you can see where this is going.", "start": 674.84, "end": 676.42}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 677.88, "end": 678.36}, {"text": "So I was on the bus and then I started to feel really sick.", "start": 678.52, "end": 681.42}, {"text": "And I was just hoping and hoping and hoping that the bus ride would be over soon.", "start": 682.26, "end": 687.56}, {"text": "And, but unfortunately it wasn't.", "start": 687.56, "end": 690.32}, {"text": "Oh no.", "start": 690.52, "end": 691.24}, {"text": "All I can say is that I was sick and all I can say is that I was pretty sick and really,", "start": 691.68, "end": 699.48}, {"text": "really unhappy.", "start": 699.82, "end": 700.66}, {"text": "Yeah, I bet.", "start": 701.02, "end": 701.88}, {"text": "Well, that's very strange that you got sick from orange juice, huh?", "start": 702.32, "end": 705.58}, {"text": "Well, yeah.", "start": 705.8, "end": 706.2}, {"text": "Maybe it was with some dirty water or something like that.", "start": 706.28, "end": 708.8}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 708.94, "end": 709.24}, {"text": "It was just, it was a terrible situation.", "start": 709.3, "end": 711.42}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 711.72, "end": 712.02}, {"text": "It's always complicated when you're traveling to other countries.", "start": 712.02, "end": 714.5}, {"text": "It could be the water.", "start": 714.5, "end": 715.42}, {"text": "It could be the, the way they prepare things.", "start": 715.42, "end": 718.6}, {"text": "So.", "start": 719.04, "end": 719.1}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 719.22, "end": 719.38}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 719.82, "end": 719.92}, {"text": "Food poisoning.", "start": 720.04, "end": 720.66}, {"text": "Guys, I hope that you don't get food poisoning.", "start": 720.9, "end": 723.12}, {"text": "And if you have any food poisoning stories, it would be great for you to share them.", "start": 723.94, "end": 727.32}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 727.46, "end": 727.74}, {"text": "At our website, englishpod.com.", "start": 727.94, "end": 730.6}, {"text": "And we'll see you there to answer all your questions and comments, but now we have to", "start": 730.74, "end": 734.2}, {"text": "go.", "start": 734.2, "end": 734.46}, {"text": "Okay, guys.", "start": 734.7, "end": 735.34}, {"text": "Thanks for listening.", "start": 735.44, "end": 735.96}, {"text": "We'll see you there.", "start": 736.24, "end": 736.92}, {"text": "Bye-bye.", "start": 737.18, "end": 737.54}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 737.64, "end": 737.82}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 738.4, "end": 738.76}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 738.92, "end": 739.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 740.28, "end": 740.64}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 741.0, "end": 741.36}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 741.36, "end": 741.4}, {"text": "", "start": 741.58, "end": 741.58}, {"text": "", "start": 741.58, "end": 741.58}